  "interpretation": "The BT1362 local Q4 clock descends through the antipodal double cover to the tomotope/Reye middle layer.  The pure C4 axis clock decomposes the 48 middle blocks as twelve four-tick cycles, while adding the translation quotient fuses them into three 16-block sheets.  Each ternary sheet hits all 16 tomotope face labels exactly once.",
